sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: A straight line commensurable with a minor straight line is minor.
----
proof:

Let {AB} be a minor straight line, and {CD} commensurable with {AB}.

I say that {CD} is also minor.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="250" height="100" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.105 diagram" src="propX105.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
